"created_at":"2025-12-11T15:42:35Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:22:10Z","closed_at":"2025-12-12T20:22:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproductible in: 4.6 dev5 and later versions\nNot reproductible in: 4.6 dev4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta1 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8157) - AMD Ryzen 7 2700X Eight-Core Processor (16 threads) - 15.94 Gio memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n**ItemLists** using fonts with **distance_field** enabled modify the image (or the display) of **StyleBoxTexture** when they are visible on the screen.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9446c87e-76e4-4dc6-840f-284ad8c4dd37)\n\nThe problem seems to affect the entries in the ItemList (but strangely not the first one):\n\n#### 4.6 dev5 - The selection **StyleBoxTexture** are only displayed on the first entry.\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/058883ab-e14a-4a76-9f65-14b455c8c7da)\n#### 4.6 dev4 - normal behavior:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/682566e1-e771-4774-a141-918b1fc2c20e)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn the MRP:\nSimply hide the **ItemList** and the StyleBoxTexture of the **Panel** will reappear.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-item-list.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24107568/bug-item-list.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","fo